  "Description": "Print an Item Label\n\nUses CLR (v7) for printing an item label.  Also allows selection of the label format.  This version also includes a modification to the Label_MasterItem View to bring in the bin location of the oldest stock.\nThis version implements 3 different label file layouts\n\nThe view LABEL_MASTERITEM is defined with a BIN field.  This specific view I am publishing has an additional column  called LATEST - it is derived from the Integration_Accpac_masterItem view which brings in a customer part number - you would need to remove this.  Also check the printing prescript on confirm.",
